'''Vanillite''' (Japanese: '''バニプッチ''' ''Vanipeti'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

